  The SDK is the single-source-of-record home: schemas/v1 (enums, views, registries, axis cards)
  generate every downstream projection (TS types, Rust constants, ordinal comparators). The
  recurring drift this directory breeds is hand-authored vocabulary — a value typed here instead
  of generated from here is how five reach vocabularies diverged. Until v1 has predicates that
  can express these checks soundly, the conventions remain authoritative prose; any future
  enforcement starts at inject/measure tier, with ask/deny reserved to operator ratification.
